<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Westpoint Stevens raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Westpoint Stevens raised.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Merrill Lynch said it raised its near- and long-term ratings on WestPoint Stevens Inc to buy from accumulate.</p>
<p>-- Additional details not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- Shares rose 1-1/8 to 32.</p>
<p>((-- Wall Street desk, 212-859-1730))</p>
</text>
